sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna
    participant ChatUI as Modul ChatUI
    participant Controller as Modul ChatController
    participant Engine as Modul KnowledgeEngine
    participant Data as Modul KnowledgeData
    participant DB as Basis Data FAQ

    Pengguna->>ChatUI: Ketik pesan & Kirim
    ChatUI->>Controller: POST /api/chat (JSON)
    Controller->>Engine: parseAndMatch(pesan)
    Engine->>Data: findFAQ(keywords)
    Data->>DB: Query tabel FAQ
    DB-->>Data: Hasil FAQ

    alt Kata Kunci Cocok (Happy Path)
        Data-->>Engine: Objek Jawaban FAQ
        Engine-->>Controller: Return Jawaban (Success)
        Controller-->>ChatUI: 200 OK (JSON Jawaban)
        ChatUI-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan Jawaban di Balon Chat
    else Kata Kunci Tidak Ditemukan (Failure Path)
        Data-->>Engine: Null (Tidak ada data)
        Engine-->>Controller: Return Fallback + Kontak TU FST
        Controller->>Data: Simpan ke unresolved_logs
        Controller-->>ChatUI: 200 OK (Pesan Fallback)
        ChatUI-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan Pesan Maaf & Tombol WA Helpdesk
    end
